data: {"id": "da9f0c8425aa48d0-final", "run_id": "da9f0c8425aa48d0", "seq": 832, "ts_ms": 1788804952690, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-wmjhr` | Running | 容器 app 处于 CrashLoopBackOff 状态，Pod 无法 Ready |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.last_terminated_reason`: \"OOMKilled\" (fact-8a46f8ab587e) | 确认 Pod 崩溃的直接原因 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `Warning BackOff ... restarting failed container app` (fact-d3827428308b) | 确认 Pod 处于反复重启循环中 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | `resource_limit.memory`: \"64Mi\" (fact-51beb05c0241) | 确定导致溢出事故的硬资源上限 |\n| 4 | Logging | Elasticsearch | 日志模式：`\"allocated_mib\"` 从 12 增至 48 (fact-582d25832db4, fact-15afeab42920) | 记录请求处理期间内存占用的持续增长过程 |\n| 5 | Tracing | Tempo/Deepflow | `span_name: GET /work`, `status_code: 200`, 关联 trace_id `497e9021c2bee1fde97ea8e31dda97f5` (fact-b37dd4c45b1b, fact-51283e0b11f6) | 关联导致内存增长的异常 HTTP 请求来源 |\n\n上述 K8s 事实确认了 Pod 因 OOMKilled 退出（Exit Code 137）并处于 CrashLoopBackOff 状态。Logging 记录证实应用在处理请求时内存分配显著增加，最高触及 48 MiB。Tracing 确认了 `/work` 接口是承载该业务请求的入口，且与日志记录的时间窗口一致。结合 64 MiB 的内存限制，证据闭环完整。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n容器内存资源限制过低 (64 MiB, 事实#3) → /work 请求处理导致内存累积 (至 48 MiB, 事实#4, #5) → 突破 64 MiB 限制触发 OOM Killer (事实#1) → Pod CrashLoopBackOff (事实#2)\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因：容器的 `resource_limit.memory` 配置过低（64 MiB），不足以支撑 `/work` 请求处理期间的内存增长需求。\n1. **证据支撑**：K8s 事件明确显示容器被 `OOMKilled` (事实#1) 且处于重启循环 (事实#2)。Logging 数据显示应用在处理 `/work` 请求时，内存占用（allocated_mib）从 12 增长至 48 (事实#4)，该过程由 Tracing 中的 `/work` 请求触发 (事实#5)。\n2. **机制分析**：应用内存最高使用量（约 48 MiB）已接近 64 MiB 的硬限制上限，导致请求处理过程中剩余内存不足以应对突发或峰值，触发 Linux OOM Killer 强制终止进程，引起容器反复崩溃重启。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.9m\n├─ 问题定位: 18.0s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 84.2s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-wmjhr: 84.2s (Evidence 74.5s, RCA 9.6s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 10.7s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-wmjhr**: pod-oomkilled, pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 112.836, "metrics": {"run_id": "da9f0c8425aa48d0", "mttr": {"value": "1.9m", "seconds": 112.84349656105042, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "45%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-oomkilled, pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 112843.49656105042, "llm_calls": 15, "llm_duration_ms": 82744.97127532959, "tool_calls": 18, "executed_tool_calls": 14, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 3, "successful_tool_calls": 16, "failed_tool_calls": 2, "tool_duration_ms": 73085.27398109436, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 29699.99408721924}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 17959.200859069824, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 84177.33883857727, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 10686.557054519653, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

